        "points": [
          "**Adverbs** say how often, or how. **always**, **also**, **well**.",
          "They sit in a **fixed** place, not anywhere.",
          "Czech *vždycky* can move. English **always** does not."
        ],
        "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 140\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" font-family=\"Lexend, sans-serif\">\n  <g font-size=\"22\" fill=\"var(--text, #eaeaea)\">\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"48\">I</text>\n    <rect x=\"48\" y=\"26\" width=\"88\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"92\" y=\"48\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" font-weight=\"600\">always</text>\n    <text x=\"146\" y=\"48\">drink coffee.</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"48\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" font-weight=\"600\">always drink</text>\n  <g font-size=\"22\" fill=\"var(--text, #eaeaea)\">\n    <text x=\"24\" y=\"112\">She is</text>\n    <rect x=\"108\" y=\"90\" width=\"88\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n    <text x=\"152\" y=\"112\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" font-weight=\"600\">always</text>\n    <text x=\"206\" y=\"112\">late.</text>\n  </g>\n  <text x=\"400\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"var(--vocab-accent, #4db6c7)\" font-weight=\"600\">after is</text>\n</svg>",
